{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px; color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #c91623;\">一体化</span>供应链</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px; color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>标准解决方案服务</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">为满足广大B商家需求，聚焦消费品、服饰、3C行业，为客户提供一体化供应链场景下的标准解决方案服务，通过标准化服务+行业增值服务灵活组合，快速报价及敏捷实施上线，为客户带来多场景、多渠道、多环节一站式高效体验。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><a href=\"/news/2846/content01050?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 20px;\">京东物控-3D SCADA &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #c91623;\">&gt;</span></span></a><br /><a href=\"/news/2846/content01050?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\">&nbsp;简洁&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 敏捷 </span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 丰富 </span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 智能&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\">&nbsp;灵活&nbsp;</span></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><a href=\"/news/2847/content01051?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 20px;\">京东物控-WCS &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #c91623;\">&gt;</span></span></a><br /><a href=\"/news/2847/content01051?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\">&nbsp;快速交付&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 灵活易用&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 成熟组件&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 稳定高效&nbsp;</span></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><a href=\"/news/2848/content01052?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 20px;\">京东物控-数字孪生 &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #c91623;\">&gt;</span></span></a><br /><a href=\"/news/2848/content01052?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\">&nbsp;设备监控&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 人员管理&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 货物监管&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 场地监控&nbsp;</span></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><a href=\"/news/2849/content01053?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 20px;\">京东物流科技园区数字防疫 &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #c91623;\">&gt;</span></span></a><br /><a href=\"/news/2849/content01053?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\">&nbsp;智能园区&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 政府物流枢纽&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 数字防疫&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 园内流调&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 事件分析&nbsp;</span></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><a href=\"/news/2850/content01054?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 20px;\">京东物流科技园区碳中和 &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #c91623;\">&gt;</span></span></a><br /><a href=\"/news/2850/content01054?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\">&nbsp;净零排放&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 碳中和战略&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 碳排放计算&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 共享碳足迹&nbsp;</span></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><a href=\"/news/2851/content01055?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 20px;\">分播墙解决方案 &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #c91623;\">&gt;</span></span></a><br /><a href=\"/news/2851/content01055?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\">&nbsp;立体&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 柔性&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 低成本&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 占地面积小&nbsp;</span></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><a href=\"/news/2852/content01056?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 20px;\">商品信任链-供应链金融 &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #c91623;\">&gt;</span></span></a><br /><a href=\"/news/2852/content01056?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\">&nbsp;产品多&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 放款快&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 利率低&nbsp;</span> &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: #ecf0f1;\"> 随借随还&nbsp;</span></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><a href=\"/news/2853/content01057?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #000